# Alembic Migrations for AsistCV

This directory contains database migrations for AsistCV.

## Usage

### Apply migrations
```bash
cd backend
uv run alembic upgrade head
```

### Create a new migration
```bash
cd backend
uv run alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description"
```

### Rollback last migration
```bash
cd backend
uv run alembic downgrade -1
```

### Generate SQL for offline migration
```bash
cd backend
uv run alembic upgrade head --sql > migration.sql
```

## Notes

- Migrations use SQLModel for model definitions
- The `vector` extension is enabled in the initial migration for future pgvector support
- Vector columns (vector(1024)) are NOT included in Sprint 0 - they will be added in Slice 1 (issue #16)
